{"id":"n0966729165","headline":"Govt tightens conditions for data centres","summary":"Malaysian authorities will stop data centre operators from benefiting from electricity subsidies meant for households and other sectors. Operators must also pay for their full reserved capacity even if they use less.","why":"Data centres are heavy electricity consumers, and their power costs shape the economics of cloud and AI infrastructure. Changes to tariffs and subsidies affect operators and investors in the sector.","category":"economy","event_type":"regulation","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Kuala Lumpur","country":"Malaysia","lat":3.139,"lon":101.687,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Free Malaysia Today | FMT","url":"https://www.freemalaysiatoday.com/category/nation/2026/10/15/govt-tightens-conditions-for-data-centres"},"sources":[{"name":"Free Malaysia Today | FMT","url":"https://www.freemalaysiatoday.com/category/nation/2026/10/15/govt-tightens-conditions-for-data-centres"}],"published_at":"2026-10-15T05:09:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T08:33:11Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"4e8e2eacd5102002","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T08:33:11Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-10-15T05:09:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-10-15T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"MY","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/data-center-servers-2476782.jpg","alt":"data center servers (illustration)","credit":"Akela999","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/electrical-data-center-2476782/"}}